<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><span lang="EN-AU" style="line-height: 107%;">I would like to apologise again, for
the service you experienced, and thank you for bringing these matters to our
attention.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font size="2"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span lang="EN-AU" style="line-height: 107%;">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to
