invitations to you*. To make use of these invitations you must be a member of
our Frequent Flyer program.</span></font></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-AU" style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Please
advise us of your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email, so we can issue
the invitations to your account. If you are not already a member, you can join
free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-AU" style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Once
we have received details of your Frequent Flyer number, we will issue the
invitations to your Frequent Flyer account and should be available for you to
use within 5-7 days.</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-AU" style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">For
